    "body": "<header>\n<span class=\"page-break\" data-page=\"244\"></span>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128475795\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Head of the Church</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128475797\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/church-organization?lang=eng\">Church Organization</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475799\" id=\"p1\">upon this rock I will build <span class=\"key-word\">my church</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Matt. 16:18</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">3 Ne. 18:16</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">21:22</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">27:8</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">D&amp;C 5:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p67#p67\">10:67</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">11:16</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">18:5</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/30?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">30:6</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/39?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">39:13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/41?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">41:3</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/42?lang=eng&amp;id=p59#p59\">42:59</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/43?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">43:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/45?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">45:1</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/69?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">69:3</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/84?lang=eng&amp;id=p32#p32\">84:32</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/104?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">104:1</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/115?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">115:3</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/119?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">119:2</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/124?lang=eng&amp;id=p41%2Cp94#p41\">124:41, 94</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/133?lang=eng&amp;id=p4%2Cp16#p4\">133:4, 16</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/136?lang=eng&amp;id=p41#p41\">136:41</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475800\" id=\"p2\">gave him to be the <span class=\"key-word\">head</span> over all things to the church, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Eph. 1:22</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475802\" id=\"p3\">which is the <span class=\"key-word\">head</span>, even Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Eph. 4:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475803\" id=\"p4\">even as Christ is the <span class=\"key-word\">head</span> of the church, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/eph/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p23#p23\">Eph. 5:23</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475805\" id=\"p5\">he is the <span class=\"key-word\">head</span> of the body, the church, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p18#p18\">Col. 1:18</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475807\" id=\"p6\">this is <span class=\"key-word\">my church</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Mosiah 26:22</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/27?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">27:13</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475808\" id=\"p7\">the <span class=\"key-word\">church</span> of Christ … who was the author, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/moro/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Moro. 6:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475809\" id=\"p8\">this <span class=\"key-word\">church</span> have I established, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/33?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">D&amp;C 33:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128475810\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rom/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Rom. 16:16</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">1 Cor. 12:27</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/1-ne/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">1 Ne. 14:12</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/25?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">2 Ne. 25:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/18?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Mosiah 18:17</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Alma 1:19</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/4-ne/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p1%2Cp29#p1\">4 Ne. 1:1, 29</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/moro/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Moro. 7:3</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
